{
  "title": "Oven Roasted Russian Beef Stew",
  "description": "This earthy and snappy Russian dish is a perfect hangover cure, featuring unwaxed lemon and cooked in a ttukbaegi earthenware pot, with anti-inflammatory friendly ingredients.",
  "cuisine": "Russian",
